      "text": "What the walk test found:\n\n&gt; A shoulder beam cut through the shell, so Claude added a round port with a bolted collar\n&gt; All 6 ball joints got 4% more clearance\n&gt; Every hydraulic rod stays at least 9.4 cm inside its sleeve https://t.co/ny2Lh46vJd",
