      "text": "Step 2: make the walk the test.\n\nClaude added ball joints, pinned hinges and 8 hydraulic cylinders, then checked every part against every other on every frame.\n\nOne rule in the prompt: fix a collision by reshaping the parts, never by touching the animation. https://t.co/nx6Vuq8lj8",
      "url": "https://x.com/higgsfield_ai/status/2123565757925879862"
    },
