      "text": "Step 1: build the mech around its pilot.\n\nA cabin that fits an adult sets the size of the torso, and the torso sets everything attached to it.\n\nAsk Claude for a scale figure in the seat, every part as its own object, and a new numbered file after each stage. https://t.co/cAhrTum5V0",
      "url": "https://x.com/higgsfield_ai/status/2123565745376555480"
    },
