      "text": "Claude Fable 5.2 modelled this mech with 184 parts fully in Blender.\n\nThen it rented a GPU and rendered the walk. 14 minutes, 17 credits.\n\nHere's the full workflow and the 4 prompts: https://t.co/2Vuj3ekwUx",
